# 🧪 Client DNS Testing

Before joining the domain, the client should be tested with:

```cmd
ipconfig /all
```

Verify:

```text
DNS Server:
192.168.50.10
```

Then:

```cmd
ping 192.168.50.10
```

Test SERVER01 by hostname:

```cmd
