```

Test the domain:

```cmd
nslookup kpatel.test
```

Test the Domain Controller's fully qualified name:

```cmd
nslookup SERVER01.kpatel.test
```

These tests confirm that the Windows client can communicate with the Domain Controller and resolve internal Active Directory DNS records.

