# 🧠 Troubleshooting Principle

Do not immediately assume:

> "Active Directory is broken."

Instead isolate the problem:

```text
Client IP
   ↓
Network connectivity
   ↓
SERVER01
   ↓
DNS
   ↓
Active Directory
   ↓
Authentication
```

This layered approach makes troubleshooting easier and prevents unnecessary configuration changes.

